WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.362
Where are agencies?

2
00:00:01.362 --> 00:00:06.882
Agencies on this path run Microsoft
365 GCC, and GCC tenants use the

3
00:00:06.882 --> 00:00:12.400
worldwide endpoints, so the Entra
source needs no endpoint change.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.513
One open question for every tenant:

5
00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:19.248
Native Change Detection's presence in
SailPoint's FedRAMP environment wasn't

6
00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:23.400
confirmed, which is one of the things
Gate 1 asks SailPoint in writing.

7
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.329
The interim path: without SailPoint,
or before it's connected,

8
00:00:27.329 --> 00:00:31.729
run the kit's reconciliation against
the HR extract and Graph alone,

9
00:00:31.729 --> 00:00:34.950
because the SailPoint
inputs are optional files.

10
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.260
Active Directory-only groups
wait for the appliance.
